WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.766
Welcome to Module 6.

00:00:01.766 --> 00:00:06.888
Today we go find di pattern wey dey hide inside your data.

00:00:07.588 --> 00:00:11.638
Check which day and which time dey busy pass.

00:00:11.638 --> 00:00:16.588
For akara seller, Saturday morning fit be di best time.

00:00:16.588 --> 00:00:17.668
Plan for am.

00:00:18.368 --> 00:00:23.237
Some goods dey finish quick, some dey sit down for shelf.

00:00:23.237 --> 00:00:27.081
Di ones wey dey sit down dey hold your money.

00:00:27.081 --> 00:00:29.216
Buy more of di fast ones.

00:00:29.916 --> 00:00:31.441
Season dey matter.

00:00:31.441 --> 00:00:38.981
Festive period, school resumption, rainy season — each one dey change how people dey buy.

00:00:38.981 --> 00:00:41.268
Compare your locations too.

00:00:41.968 --> 00:00:48.736
When you sabi di pattern, you go prepare before di busy time reach, instead of to dey regret after.

00:00:49.436 --> 00:00:53.720
Look your last two months and find your best day.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.556
See you for Module 7!
